      (4) SSE frame carrying ledger_ref + disposition (storage-precedes-rendering); (5) supersession semantics
      for undo/replace (FR-17, task 034). FR-04 is the draft-into-editor leg — the first consumer of the
      disposition. Depends on Spike 0 (000) validating the dispatch/mount path.
    </background>
