  <justification component="Draft-into-editor materialization (consumes core disposition)">
    <existing>The session-dispatch seam + ledger + `DocumentStreamWriter` side channel exist; the editor materialization seam (`docxBytes`/setContent) exists.</existing>
    <extension>Wire the core `compose` disposition to the existing materialization seam; no new endpoint, no local payload path.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Without it, "draft into Compose" produces nothing durable in the editor (or a refresh-losing client buffer); FR-04 unmet and the flagship gate's draft-into-editor leg (082) fails.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

